/Title (We also replaced the power distribution board, which was abominably expensive and only partially functional, with the Relay Board at roughly one-eighth of the cost and twice the functionality. The Relay Board allows us to control all the cooling systems through the MoTeC ECU as well as manually by the driver.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
