/Title (The IT team has been working around the clock to get our website up and running at www.ashwaracing.org The website code is fully open source and available at our organization's GitHub. The website is fully up and logs our current newsletters, along with a gallery with exclusive images, our prototypes from the beginning of the club, and other details. Do visit the website!)
